# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Deliberately NOT ignored: *.dof and *.cfg below Packages.
# They carry the search path. Without it SynEdit.inc cannot find its
# SynEditJedi.inc - a nested include is resolved through the search path, not
# relative to the including file - and a fresh clone will not build. The
# Delphi 7 IDE regenerates the .cfg from the .dof on every build, so seeing it
# in a diff is expected, not a defect.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local single-package setup used with a private build tool. The public
# packages live in Packages/<IDE> so that a plain Delphi installation is enough.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Source/Packages/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Dictionary of the spell check suite (15.9 MB binary blob, never changes and
# is not needed to compile). It ships with the spell check distribution the
# units came from.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Dictionary.7z

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local deployment staging area (a copy of the tree plus the dictionary, 23 MB).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
_Data/
